+// 摘要輸入逐項：建置器版本、原版雜湊、譯文表雜湊、補丁雜湊、模式、三個政策旗標各改一個，摘要必須改變。
+func TestDigestInputsEachMatter(t *testing.T) {
+	orig := map[string]string{}
+	for i, n := range verify.InputNames() {
+		orig[n] = sha256Hex([]byte{byte(i)})
+	}
+	base := digestInput{Version: "v1", Orig: orig, TableHash: emptyTableHash, PatchHash: "", Policy: verify.Policy{Mode: "table"}}
+	d0 := digestOf(base)
+	if digestOf(base) != d0 || len(d0) != 64 {
+		t.Fatal("摘要不穩定")
+	}
+	variants := map[string]func(*digestInput){
+		"版本":              func(d *digestInput) { d.Version = "v2" },
+		"表雜湊":             func(d *digestInput) { d.TableHash = sha256Hex([]byte("t")) },
+		"補丁雜湊":            func(d *digestInput) { d.PatchHash = "p" },
+		"模式":              func(d *digestInput) { d.Policy.Mode = "identity" },
+		"with-candidates": func(d *digestInput) { d.Policy.WithCandidates = true },
+		"allow-country":   func(d *digestInput) { d.Policy.AllowCountryOffsets = true },
+		"allow-shoptab":   func(d *digestInput) { d.Policy.AllowShoptab = true },
+		"原版輸入 SP.MES":     func(d *digestInput) { d.Orig = copyMap(orig); d.Orig["SP.MES"] = sha256Hex([]byte("x")) },
+		"原版輸入 MAIN.EXE":   func(d *digestInput) { d.Orig = copyMap(orig); d.Orig["MAIN.EXE"] = sha256Hex([]byte("x")) },
+		"原版輸入 CFONT.15":   func(d *digestInput) { d.Orig = copyMap(orig); d.Orig["CFONT.15"] = sha256Hex([]byte("x")) },
+	}
+	seen := map[string]string{d0: "base"}
+	for name, mut := range variants {
+		d := base
+		mut(&d)
+		got := digestOf(d)
+		if got == d0 {
+			t.Errorf("改 %s 沒有改變摘要", name)
+		}
+		if prev, dup := seen[got]; dup {
+			t.Errorf("改 %s 與 %s 得到相同的摘要", name, prev)
+		}
+		seen[got] = name
+	}
+	// 政策旗標的序列化順序固定：三個旗標各開一個，字串互不相同。
+	p := []verify.Policy{{Mode: "table", WithCandidates: true}, {Mode: "table", AllowCountryOffsets: true}, {Mode: "table", AllowShoptab: true}}
+	if p[0].Canonical() == p[1].Canonical() || p[1].Canonical() == p[2].Canonical() || p[0].Canonical() == p[2].Canonical() {
+		t.Error("政策序列化沒有區分三個旗標")
+	}
+}
